    "text": "Consider the two sets:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo></math> both the roots of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are real <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>}</mo></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br />Which of the following is not true?"
  },
