  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since both roots are real&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
